{"seq":2,"slug":"goap-planning","title":"目标导向行动规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/behavior-patterns/goap-planning","wordCount":795,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"目标导向行动规划\">目标导向行动规划</h1><p>目标导向行动规划（Goal-Oriented Action Planning，GOAP）是由 Jeff Orkin 在 2003 年为 F.E.A.R. 开发的 AI 决策系统。F.E.A.R. 的 AI 士兵凭借 GOAP 表现出令人印象深刻的战术行为，在敌方掩护不可用时会主动寻找新掩护点，在弹药不足时优先获取弹药补给，这些行为并非手工编写，而是 GOAP 自动规划出来的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GOAP 的工作原理类似 AI 问题求解：给定当前<strong>世界状态</strong>和<strong>目标状态</strong>，通过搜索<strong>可用行动</strong>的序列，找到一条从当前状态通向目标状态的路径。这条路径就是 AI 的行动计划。</p>\n<p>三个核心组成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>世界状态（World State）</strong>：键值对集合，描述当前世界中的事实（&quot;hasAmmo&quot; = true，&quot;isNearCover&quot; = false）</li>\n<li><strong>目标（Goal）</strong>：期望达成的世界状态条件（&quot;enemyDead&quot; = true）</li>\n<li><strong>行动（Action）</strong>：具有前置条件（Preconditions）和效果（Effects）的操作单元</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"行动的前置条件与效果\">行动的前置条件与效果</h2><p>每个行动定义了两个核心属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class GOAPAction&#10;{&#10;    public string Name { get; private set; }&#10;    public float Cost { get; protected set; }&#10;&#10;    // 前置条件：执行此行动需要满足的世界状态&#10;    protected Dictionary&lt;string, bool&gt; preconditions&#10;        = new Dictionary&lt;string, bool&gt;();&#10;&#10;    // 效果：执行此行动后世界状态的变化&#10;    protected Dictionary&lt;string, bool&gt; effects&#10;        = new Dictionary&lt;string, bool&gt;();&#10;&#10;    // 运行时是否可执行（过程检查）&#10;    public virtual bool CheckProceduralPrecondition(&#10;        GameObject agent, GOAPWorldState worldState)&#10;        =&gt; true;&#10;&#10;    public virtual bool Perform(GameObject agent) =&gt; true;&#10;&#10;    public bool IsAchievable()&#10;    {&#10;        return true; // 基础实现，子类可重写&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public bool IsAchievableGiven(Dictionary&lt;string, bool&gt; conditions)&#10;    {&#10;        foreach (var precond in preconditions)&#10;        {&#10;            if (!conditions.ContainsKey(precond.Key)&#10;                || conditions[precond.Key] != precond.Value)&#10;                return false;&#10;        }&#10;        return true;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class GOAPAction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string Name { get; private set; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float Cost { get; protected set; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 前置条件：执行此行动需要满足的世界状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    protected Dictionary&#x3C;string, bool> preconditions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        = new Dictionary&#x3C;string, bool>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 效果：执行此行动后世界状态的变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    protected Dictionary&#x3C;string, bool> effects</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        = new Dictionary&#x3C;string, bool>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 运行时是否可执行（过程检查）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public virtual bool CheckProceduralPrecondition(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameObject agent, GOAPWorldState worldState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        => true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public virtual bool Perform(GameObject agent) => true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public bool IsAchievable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return true; // 基础实现，子类可重写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public bool IsAchievableGiven(Dictionary&#x3C;string, bool> conditions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var precond in preconditions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (!conditions.ContainsKey(precond.Key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                || conditions[precond.Key] != precond.Value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型行动集合（战斗 NPC）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>行动</th>\n<th>前置条件</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AttackEnemy</td>\n<td>hasAmmo=true, enemyVisible=true</td>\n<td>enemyDead=true</td>\n<td>10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ReloadWeapon</td>\n<td>hasAmmoInPouch=true</td>\n<td>hasAmmo=true</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PickUpAmmo</td>\n<td>ammoNearby=true</td>\n<td>hasAmmoInPouch=true</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FindCover</td>\n<td>none</td>\n<td>inCover=true</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ShootFromCover</td>\n<td>inCover=true, enemyVisible=true, hasAmmo=true</td>\n<td>enemyDead=true</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class AttackEnemyAction : GOAPAction&#10;{&#10;    public AttackEnemyAction()&#10;    {&#10;        Name = &quot;AttackEnemy&quot;;&#10;        Cost = 10f;&#10;        preconditions[&quot;hasAmmo&quot;] = true;&#10;        preconditions[&quot;enemyVisible&quot;] = true;&#10;        effects[&quot;enemyDead&quot;] = true;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override bool CheckProceduralPrecondition(&#10;        GameObject agent, GOAPWorldState worldState)&#10;    {&#10;        // 运行时检查：敌人是否真的在视线内&#10;        var perception = agent.GetComponent&lt;EnemyPerception&gt;();&#10;        return perception.CanSeeEnemy();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override bool Perform(GameObject agent)&#10;    {&#10;        var combatSystem = agent.GetComponent&lt;CombatSystem&gt;();&#10;        combatSystem.FireWeapon();&#10;        return true;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class AttackEnemyAction : GOAPAction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public AttackEnemyAction()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Name = \"AttackEnemy\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Cost = 10f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        preconditions[\"hasAmmo\"] = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        preconditions[\"enemyVisible\"] = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        effects[\"enemyDead\"] = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override bool CheckProceduralPrecondition(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameObject agent, GOAPWorldState worldState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 运行时检查：敌人是否真的在视线内</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var perception = agent.GetComponent&#x3C;EnemyPerception>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return perception.CanSeeEnemy();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override bool Perform(GameObject agent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var combatSystem = agent.GetComponent&#x3C;CombatSystem>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        combatSystem.FireWeapon();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"a-规划搜索\">A* 规划搜索</h2><p>GOAP 的规划过程本质上是一个<strong>反向 A* 搜索</strong>：从目标状态出发，寻找哪些行动的效果能满足当前需求，再递归寻找满足这些行动前置条件的行动，直到当前世界状态能够满足所有前置条件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[当前状态\\nhasAmmo=false\\nenemyVisible=true] --&gt; |ReloadWeapon| B[hasAmmo=true\\nenemyVisible=true]&#10;    A --&gt; |PickUpAmmo| C[hasAmmoInPouch=true]&#10;    C --&gt; |ReloadWeapon| B&#10;    B --&gt; |AttackEnemy| D[目标达成\\nenemyDead=true]\">graph LR\n    A[当前状态\\nhasAmmo=false\\nenemyVisible=true] --&gt; |ReloadWeapon| B[hasAmmo=true\\nenemyVisible=true]\n    A --&gt; |PickUpAmmo| C[hasAmmoInPouch=true]\n    C --&gt; |ReloadWeapon| B\n    B --&gt; |AttackEnemy| D[目标达成\\nenemyDead=true]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class GOAPPlanner&#10;{&#10;    public Queue&lt;GOAPAction&gt; Plan(&#10;        GameObject agent,&#10;        HashSet&lt;GOAPAction&gt; availableActions,&#10;        Dictionary&lt;string, bool&gt; currentWorldState,&#10;        GOAPGoal goal)&#10;    {&#10;        // 找出可运行的行动（过程前置条件满足）&#10;        var usableActions = availableActions&#10;            .Where(a =&gt; a.CheckProceduralPrecondition(agent,&#10;                new GOAPWorldState(currentWorldState)))&#10;            .ToHashSet();&#10;&#10;        var leaves = new List&lt;PlanNode&gt;();&#10;        var start = new PlanNode(null, 0, currentWorldState, null);&#10;&#10;        // 反向 A* 搜索&#10;        bool success = BuildGraph(start, leaves, usableActions, goal);&#10;&#10;        if (!success) return null; // 规划失败&#10;&#10;        // 找到最低成本路径&#10;        PlanNode cheapest = leaves&#10;            .OrderBy(n =&gt; n.RunningCost)&#10;            .First();&#10;&#10;        // 回溯路径，构建行动队列&#10;        var plan = new Stack&lt;GOAPAction&gt;();&#10;        var node = cheapest;&#10;        while (node != null)&#10;        {&#10;            if (node.Action != null)&#10;                plan.Push(node.Action);&#10;            node = node.Parent;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        return new Queue&lt;GOAPAction&gt;(plan);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private bool BuildGraph(&#10;        PlanNode parent,&#10;        List&lt;PlanNode&gt; leaves,&#10;        HashSet&lt;GOAPAction&gt; usableActions,&#10;        GOAPGoal goal)&#10;    {&#10;        bool foundPath = false;&#10;&#10;        foreach (var action in usableActions)&#10;        {&#10;            if (!action.IsAchievableGiven(parent.State)) continue;&#10;&#10;            // 应用行动效果到状态&#10;            var newState = ApplyEffects(parent.State, action);&#10;            var node = new PlanNode(parent,&#10;                parent.RunningCost + action.Cost, newState, action);&#10;&#10;            if (GoalAchieved(goal, newState))&#10;            {&#10;                leaves.Add(node);&#10;                foundPath = true;&#10;            }&#10;            else&#10;            {&#10;                // 递归搜索&#10;                var subset = usableActions.Except(new[] { action }).ToHashSet();&#10;                bool found = BuildGraph(node, leaves, subset, goal);&#10;                if (found) foundPath = true;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        return foundPath;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private Dictionary&lt;string, bool&gt; ApplyEffects(&#10;        Dictionary&lt;string, bool&gt; currentState,&#10;        GOAPAction action)&#10;    {&#10;        var newState = new Dictionary&lt;string, bool&gt;(currentState);&#10;        foreach (var effect in action.Effects)&#10;            newState[effect.Key] = effect.Value;&#10;        return newState;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private bool GoalAchieved(&#10;        GOAPGoal goal, Dictionary&lt;string, bool&gt; currentState)&#10;    {&#10;        foreach (var condition in goal.Conditions)&#10;        {&#10;            if (!currentState.TryGetValue(condition.Key, out bool val)&#10;                || val != condition.Value)&#10;                return false;&#10;        }&#10;        return true;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class GOAPPlanner</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Queue&#x3C;GOAPAction> Plan(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameObject agent,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        HashSet&#x3C;GOAPAction> availableActions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Dictionary&#x3C;string, bool> currentWorldState,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GOAPGoal goal)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 找出可运行的行动（过程前置条件满足）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var usableActions = availableActions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .Where(a => a.CheckProceduralPrecondition(agent,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                new GOAPWorldState(currentWorldState)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .ToHashSet();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var leaves = new List&#x3C;PlanNode>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var start = new PlanNode(null, 0, currentWorldState, null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 反向 A* 搜索</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bool success = BuildGraph(start, leaves, usableActions, goal);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!success) return null; // 规划失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 找到最低成本路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PlanNode cheapest = leaves</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .OrderBy(n => n.RunningCost)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .First();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 回溯路径，构建行动队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var plan = new Stack&#x3C;GOAPAction>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var node = cheapest;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (node != null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (node.Action != null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                plan.Push(node.Action);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            node = node.Parent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return new Queue&#x3C;GOAPAction>(plan);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool BuildGraph(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PlanNode parent,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        List&#x3C;PlanNode> leaves,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        HashSet&#x3C;GOAPAction> usableActions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GOAPGoal goal)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bool foundPath = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var action in usableActions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (!action.IsAchievableGiven(parent.State)) continue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 应用行动效果到状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var newState = ApplyEffects(parent.State, action);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var node = new PlanNode(parent,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                parent.RunningCost + action.Cost, newState, action);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (GoalAchieved(goal, newState))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                leaves.Add(node);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                foundPath = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                // 递归搜索</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                var subset = usableActions.Except(new[] { action }).ToHashSet();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                bool found = BuildGraph(node, leaves, subset, goal);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (found) foundPath = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return foundPath;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Dictionary&#x3C;string, bool> ApplyEffects(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Dictionary&#x3C;string, bool> currentState,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GOAPAction action)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var newState = new Dictionary&#x3C;string, bool>(currentState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var effect in action.Effects)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            newState[effect.Key] = effect.Value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return newState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool GoalAchieved(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GOAPGoal goal, Dictionary&#x3C;string, bool> currentState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var condition in goal.Conditions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (!currentState.TryGetValue(condition.Key, out bool val)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                || val != condition.Value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"goap-agent-执行循环\">GOAP Agent 执行循环</h2><p>规划出行动队列后，Agent 需要一个执行循环来逐步执行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class GOAPAgent : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private Queue&lt;GOAPAction&gt; currentPlan;&#10;    private GOAPAction currentAction;&#10;    private GOAPGoal currentGoal;&#10;    private bool planFailed;&#10;&#10;    private void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        // 无计划或计划失败时，重新规划&#10;        if (currentPlan == null || planFailed)&#10;        {&#10;            currentGoal = SelectGoal();&#10;            currentPlan = planner.Plan(&#10;                gameObject, GetAvailableActions(),&#10;                GetCurrentWorldState(), currentGoal);&#10;&#10;            if (currentPlan == null)&#10;            {&#10;                // 规划失败，执行 Idle 行为&#10;                OnPlanFailed();&#10;                return;&#10;            }&#10;&#10;            planFailed = false;&#10;            currentAction = null;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 执行当前行动&#10;        if (currentAction == null || currentAction.IsDone())&#10;        {&#10;            if (currentPlan.Count == 0)&#10;            {&#10;                // 计划执行完毕&#10;                OnPlanComplete();&#10;                currentPlan = null;&#10;                return;&#10;            }&#10;&#10;            currentAction = currentPlan.Dequeue();&#10;&#10;            // 过程前置条件失效，放弃当前计划&#10;            if (!currentAction.CheckProceduralPrecondition(&#10;                gameObject, GetCurrentWorldState()))&#10;            {&#10;                planFailed = true;&#10;                return;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 执行行动&#10;        bool success = currentAction.Perform(gameObject);&#10;        if (!success)&#10;            planFailed = true;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private GOAPGoal SelectGoal()&#10;    {&#10;        // 按优先级选择当前最重要的目标&#10;        return goals.OrderByDescending(g =&gt; g.Priority).First();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class GOAPAgent : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Queue&#x3C;GOAPAction> currentPlan;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private GOAPAction currentAction;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private GOAPGoal currentGoal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool planFailed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 无计划或计划失败时，重新规划</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (currentPlan == null || planFailed)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            currentGoal = SelectGoal();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            currentPlan = planner.Plan(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                gameObject, GetAvailableActions(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                GetCurrentWorldState(), currentGoal);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (currentPlan == null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                // 规划失败，执行 Idle 行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                OnPlanFailed();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            planFailed = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            currentAction = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 执行当前行动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (currentAction == null || currentAction.IsDone())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (currentPlan.Count == 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                // 计划执行完毕</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                OnPlanComplete();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                currentPlan = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            currentAction = currentPlan.Dequeue();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 过程前置条件失效，放弃当前计划</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (!currentAction.CheckProceduralPrecondition(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                gameObject, GetCurrentWorldState()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                planFailed = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 执行行动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bool success = currentAction.Perform(gameObject);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!success)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            planFailed = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private GOAPGoal SelectGoal()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 按优先级选择当前最重要的目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return goals.OrderByDescending(g => g.Priority).First();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"动态世界状态与重规划\">动态世界状态与重规划</h2><p>GOAP 的强大之处在于能够响应环境变化进行<strong>重规划</strong>。当感知系统检测到世界状态发生重大变化时（队友阵亡、掩护被摧毁），Agent 立即放弃当前计划并重新搜索：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"private void OnWorldStateChanged(string key, bool oldValue, bool newValue)&#10;{&#10;    // 检查变化是否影响当前计划的可行性&#10;    if (currentAction != null)&#10;    {&#10;        bool planStillValid = currentAction.IsAchievableGiven(&#10;            GetCurrentWorldState());&#10;&#10;        if (!planStillValid)&#10;        {&#10;            // 立即触发重规划&#10;            currentPlan = null;&#10;            planFailed = false;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>private void OnWorldStateChanged(string key, bool oldValue, bool newValue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 检查变化是否影响当前计划的可行性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (currentAction != null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bool planStillValid = currentAction.IsAchievableGiven(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            GetCurrentWorldState());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!planStillValid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 立即触发重规划</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            currentPlan = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            planFailed = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"goap-的适用边界\">GOAP 的适用边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>不适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行动集合 10-30 个，组合关系复杂</td>\n<td>行动简单（&lt; 5 个），用 FSM 更直接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 需要动态应对环境变化</td>\n<td>需要严格可预测的行为序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设计师需要添加新行动而不改结构</td>\n<td>性能敏感（大量 NPC 同时规划）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GOAP 的规划搜索在行动数量较多时有性能开销。实际项目中常用的优化：限制搜索深度、缓存规划结果、只在关键时刻重规划、用多线程异步规划。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>GOAP 通过世界状态 + 行动的前置/效果定义，将行为设计从「手工连线」变成「规划搜索」。设计师只需定义行动和目标，AI 自动组合出合理的行动序列。核心优势是应对动态情况的灵活性和行动组合的自动化，代价是调试复杂度和规划开销。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"behavior-trees\">行为树</a> — 基于树形结构的序列化行为决策，与 GOAP 互补</li>\n<li><a href=\"utility-ai\">效用系统</a> — 基于评分权衡的连续决策，适合需要「权衡」的情境</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"目标导向行动规划","id":"目标导向行动规划"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"行动的前置条件与效果","id":"行动的前置条件与效果"},{"level":2,"text":"A* 规划搜索","id":"a-规划搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"GOAP Agent 执行循环","id":"goap-agent-执行循环"},{"level":2,"text":"动态世界状态与重规划","id":"动态世界状态与重规划"},{"level":2,"text":"GOAP 的适用边界","id":"goap-的适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"行为树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/behavior-patterns/behavior-trees"},"next":{"title":"效用系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/behavior-patterns/utility-ai"}}